{"dur": 26.7, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Quatre-vingts pour cent.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 2.441, "words": [{"w": "Quatre-vingts", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "pour", "t": 1.902}, {"w": "cent.", "t": 2.172}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "C'est la part de ton temps qui ne sert à rien.", "t0": 3.141, "t1": 5.64, "words": [{"w": "C'est", "t": 3.141}, {"w": "la", "t": 3.467}, {"w": "part", "t": 3.63}, {"w": "de", "t": 3.902}, {"w": "ton", "t": 4.065}, {"w": "temps", "t": 4.282}, {"w": "qui", "t": 4.608}, {"w": "ne", "t": 4.825}, {"w": "sert", "t": 4.988}, {"w": "à", "t": 5.26}, {"w": "rien.", "t": 5.369}]}, {"id": "detail", "text": "Sur un plan de ferraillage, quatre-vingts pour cent du temps, c'est du dessin. Pas du calcul.", "t0": 6.44, "t1": 11.604, "words": [{"w": "Sur", "t": 6.44}, {"w": "un", "t": 6.672}, {"w": "plan", "t": 6.846}, {"w": "de", "t": 7.137}, {"w": "ferraillage,", "t": 7.311}, {"w": "quatre-vingts", "t": 8.007}, {"w": "pour", "t": 8.761}, {"w": "cent", "t": 9.051}, {"w": "du", "t": 9.341}, {"w": "temps,", "t": 9.516}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 9.864}, {"w": "du", "t": 10.212}, {"w": "dessin.", "t": 10.386}, {"w": "Pas", "t": 10.792}, {"w": "du", "t": 11.024}, {"w": "calcul.", "t": 11.198}]}, {"id": "verite", "text": "Le calcul, c'est ton métier. Le dessin, c'est juste de la main-d'œuvre.", "t0": 11.984, "t1": 16.423, "words": [{"w": "Le", "t": 11.984}, {"w": "calcul,", "t": 12.183}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 12.647}, {"w": "ton", "t": 13.044}, {"w": "métier.", "t": 13.309}, {"w": "Le", "t": 13.773}, {"w": "dessin,", "t": 13.972}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 14.435}, {"w": "juste", "t": 14.833}, {"w": "de", "t": 15.23}, {"w": "la", "t": 15.429}, {"w": "main-d'œuvre.", "t": 15.628}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI prend le dessin. Il te laisse le métier.", "t0": 16.803, "t1": 20.471, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 16.803}, {"w": "AI", "t": 17.45}, {"w": "prend", "t": 17.666}, {"w": "le", "t": 18.097}, {"w": "dessin.", "t": 18.313}, {"w": "Il", "t": 18.817}